 ## 部署步骤
 
+### FR-6 | systemd worker 切到工作树构建产物
+
+只改配置指向,不改安装内容(design.md ADR-1)。`ExecStart` 与 `ExecStopPost` **两行同改**——只改 `ExecStart` 会出现"新码启动、旧码停止"的混搭(facts.md F4);`WorkingDirectory=%h/.agentmemory` 与 `EnvironmentFile` 不动。
+
+1. 改前两行(`~/.config/systemd/user/agentmemory.service`):
+   ```
+   ExecStart=%h/.local/bin/node %h/.nvm/versions/node/v24.18.0/lib/node_modules/@agentmemory/agentmemory/dist/cli.mjs --verbose
+   ExecStopPost=-%h/.local/bin/node %h/.nvm/versions/node/v24.18.0/lib/node_modules/@agentmemory/agentmemory/dist/cli.mjs stop --force
+   ```
+
+2. 写前备份(先备份再写,坑库 P34):
+   ```
+   cp -p /home/ky/.config/systemd/user/agentmemory.service /home/ky/.local/state/agentmemory-msi/agentmemory.service.pre-msi.bak
+   ```
+   预期输出:备份文件生成,`diff` 备份与源文件为空(内容一致)。
+
+3. 改两行,只替换 node 参数路径为工作树构建产物,各自的后续参数(`--verbose` / `stop --force`)与 `ExecStopPost` 行首的 `-` 前缀保持原样:
+   ```
+   ExecStart=%h/.local/bin/node /home/ky/git/source-project/agentmemory/dist/cli.mjs --verbose
+   ExecStopPost=-%h/.local/bin/node /home/ky/git/source-project/agentmemory/dist/cli.mjs stop --force
+   ```
+
+4. 执行序(daemon-reload → restart → 探活):
+   ```
+   systemctl --user daemon-reload
+   systemctl --user restart agentmemory
+   systemctl --user is-active agentmemory
+   curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" http://localhost:3111/agentmemory/livez
+   ```
+   预期输出:`is-active` 返回 `active`;`livez` 返回 `200`。
+
+5. 探活验证(实跑判据):
+   ```
+   bash pipeline/memory-scope-isolation/generated/cases/C-FR6-1.sh   # unit 两行指向工作树 dist/cli.mjs、服务 active、livez 200
+   bash pipeline/memory-scope-isolation/generated/cases/C-FR6-2.sh   # 真实 REST 写入一条一次性 agentId 记忆后按该 agentId 读回 total >= 1
+   ```
+   预期输出:两条均 `CASE ... PASS`,exit 0。`C-FR6-2` 每跑一轮向真实记忆库写入一条 `concepts` 含 `pipeline-probe` 的探针记录(design.md 风险 R-4,已被接受,不在此清理)。
